#~ msgid "Sounds of a scuffle were heard from the forest."
#~ msgstr "숲 속에서 실랑이를 벌이는 소리가 들려온다."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "It is whispered that hungry ghosts rule this forest, and kill everyone "
